<title>SWEDEN: Swedish mobile phone sales rise sharply in Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish mobile phone sales rise sharply in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 85,240 mobile telephones were sold in Sweden in February this year, up from 48,371 in the same month in 1996, the industry group Mobile Telephone Deliverers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Out of the phones sold last month, 81,287 were GSM phones.</p>
<p>In the past 12 months the number of mobile phones sold in Sweden has risen 29.6 percent to 1.09 million.</p>
<p>-- Erik Aronsson, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1010</p>
</text>
